{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>  </strong></i><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/AboutTheGame_eng.jpg?t=1745500452\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Punch and push your way up\u00a0and reach new heights as fast as possible!&quot;</strong><br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/Eagle.gif?t=1745500452\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><strong>APEDROP</strong> is a retro-inspired action puzzle game in the style of Dr. Mario, Donkey Kong and Tetris. Punch, Jump, Push, Spin, Run and reach the top of the rankings!\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/SteamGif-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1745500452\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Ranking system!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game controls customization.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local</strong> player versus player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 Characters to choose from with more to come!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternative visuals!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3495060/extras/PowerUp.gif?t=1745500452\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A note from Canary:<br><br><i>We hope that you have fun with this game! We had a blast creating it and this is our first step toward bigger things, thank you for your support!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>&quot;You inside the blocky arena&quot;</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou